    "long_instructions": "## Maya's School Club Page\r\n\r\nIn this level, we're going to help Maya, who is struggling with her use of AI. Here is what she says:\r\n\r\n*\"I asked for a colorful page but it looks like a rainbow exploded on it. Every single thing is a different color - the heading, the paragraphs, the list items. That's not what I meant at all. I just wanted it to feel fun and bright, not chaotic.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Read Maya's `vision.md` file to understand what she asked for\r\n2) Decide how you want to fix it. You can update the `vision.md` file to be more specific and have AI Tutor regenerate the page, or go step-by-step with AI Tutor to fix the issues.\r\n\r\nKeep working with AI Tutor until you think the webpage addresses Maya's feedback. Once it does: press the Continue button!\r\n\r\n**Hint:** Think about how you can clarify what \"colorful\" means using specific color terms you've learned - like color names for specific elements.",
